# UI Density and Proportion Preferences

When working on web UI in this project:

- Prefer compact, efficient layouts over spacious ones.
- Avoid large empty regions, especially in top sections and headers.
- Use balanced multi-column composition on desktop so space is actively used.
- Keep controls dense but readable: smaller paddings, tighter gaps, clear hierarchy.
- Avoid oversized "card on card" wrappers for filter/tool areas unless requested.
- Keep metric/status rows clean and compact with strong alignment.
- Prioritize practical utility and visual proportion over decorative styling.

